The review based on my experience about this PG.

Food:
 Food is very, very worst here. They mention it as home food, but the food taste is very bad. I wasted food many times. Till now, I didn't have tasty food here.

Quality of Food:
 No vegetables, 100 liters of water in sambar, unwanted masalas. The kitchen is very bad here. The water which they use for making food is unhygienic. I attached some photos, you guys can see that.

Food Menu:
 Mostly sambar without vegetables, 2 times chicken per week, but the chicken has too much masala and the gravy is very bad. I'll eat the chicken pieces only. Weekly once egg, chapati, poori, bonda, idly, and dosa.

Food Limited:
 For each person, they will serve only 2-3 chapatis, pooris, dosas, or bondas. After that, they won't serve more. Along with that, they'll keep rice with buttermilk mixed with a lot of water. We cannot eat that also. I have to eat some snacks during the day to fulfil my stomach.

Issues I Suffered from the Food:

I got food poisoning twice here.
I suffered from fever. The doctor said to drink hot water and eat healthy food. Here, a kettle is not allowed, so I used to go to the kitchen for boiling water. The kitchen chef scolded me and told me not to boil water. I don't know what the issue is.
Here, you cannot find a single healthy food item. You won't get any proper vitamins or minerals.
I attached hospital bills also in the photos.

Restrictions:
 Iron box, egg boiler, kettle, and induction stove are not allowed here. Then how can professional employees go to the office or mall without ironing their shirts and pants?

Lift usage is only from morning 6 AM to night 10 PM. Late-night employees are suffering because of this.

For fetching water at night, you need to go to the kitchen. They keep only one 30-liter water can for two floors. It will be empty within half a day. They won't refill it until the next day. If you want water, you need to go to the kitchen.

I attached photos of the unhygienic water cans also.

Morning:
 Water heater (geyser) timing is 6 AM to 9 AM. After that, the warden will switch it off. In between, water won't come for 30-50 minutes sometimes, but he will still switch off the geyser on time.

Night Time:
 Water heater (geyser) timing is 7 PM to 9 PM.

Chair and Table:
 Chair and table are not provided for work or study.

Bedsheet:
 Even bedsheet covers are not provided. I'll attach photos, kindly check them.

Rats and Dogs:
 One of my roommates got bitten by a rat while sleeping.

At night, you can see dogs near the balcony outside the room. One day, I got shocked after seeing a street dog at night. Dogs come and eat the food waste outside the dustbin. Every night they come and roam around there.

Hygiene of PG:
 They mop and clean every day. They also clean the washrooms regularly.

Room Size and Bed Quality:
 The room size is very, very small. You cannot even sleep properly because the beds are very close to each other. Sometimes roommates' hands and legs touch you. The space between the beds is very small. You cannot walk properly if some people are sleeping. You cannot change clothes freely either. It is very congested here.

There are no plug points near each bed. There are only 2 plug points for the entire room with 3-4 sharing. Most of the rooms also do not have proper ventilation.
